            <h2>Batteries v3.1.1</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Picking an app under Apps Using Significant Energy now shows it in Activity Monitor.</li>
                    <li>The menu bar battery icon now matches the system's colors, including in Low Power Mode.</li>
                    <li>Subtler percentages in your devices' battery icons.</li>
                    <li>The Touch Bar setting is hidden on Macs without a Touch Bar.</li>
                </ul>
